PTX dsmem-red+cluster-barrier
"Cluster top-k: CTAs add counts into another CTA's shared memory with red.relaxed.cluster.shared::cluster, then barrier.cluster.arrive.release and barrier.cluster.wait.acquire; the owner CTA then reads the counts (CCCL cub/agent/agent_batched_topk_cluster.cuh:783, 814-820, 1166-1173). Expected: forbidden."
{
x=0 @cta 1;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                     | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0       ;
 red.relaxed.cluster.shared::cluster.add x, 1 | barrier.cluster.arrive.release ;
 barrier.cluster.arrive.release               | barrier.cluster.wait.acquire   ;
 barrier.cluster.wait.acquire                 | ld.weak.shared::cta r0, x      ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 0)
